	(text "T1/T2: 2 x HM2410-ND / Hammond 117K16. These weigh 680.4 g EACH\nIsolation transformers wiring:\nJ3 Pin2 (Amplifier +) connects to the first 117K16 8Ohm pin\nJ3 Pin1 (Amplifier -) connects to the first 117K16 bottom 0\nFirst 117K16 COM to Second 117K16 COM\nFirst 117K16 16W to Second 117K16 16W\nSecond 117K16 bottom 0 to Speaker -ve\nSecond 117K16 8Ohm to Speaker +ve\nInsulate unused taps.\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
